{"task_id": "Mbpp/20", "solution": "def is_woodall(number: int) -> bool:\n    \"\"\"Checks if the given number is a Woodall number.\n    A number N is a Woodall number if it can be expressed in the form n * 2^n - 1\n    for some non-negative integer n.\n    \"\"\"\n    if number < -1:  # Woodall numbers are n * 2^n - 1, which are generally non-negative.\n        return False\n    \n    n = 0\n    while True:\n        woodall_candidate = n * (2**n) - 1\n        if woodall_candidate == number:\n            return True\n        elif woodall_candidate > number:\n            return False\n        n += 1"}
