{"task_id": "Mbpp/61", "solution": "def count_Substrings(input_string: str) -> int:\n    \"\"\"\n    Counts the number of substrings with the sum of digits equal to their length.\n    Iterates through all possible substrings and checks the condition.\n    \"\"\"\n    valid_substring_count = 0\n    n = len(input_string)\n\n    for i in range(n):\n        current_sum = 0\n        for j in range(i, n):\n            # current_substring_value = input_string[i:j+1]\n            # current_substring_length = len(current_substring_value)\n            # current_substring_sum_of_digits = sum(int(digit) for digit in current_substring_value)\n\n            # Optimization: Calculate sum and length incrementally\n            current_sum += int(input_string[j])\n            current_substring_length = (j - i) + 1\n\n            if current_sum == current_substring_length:\n                valid_substring_count += 1\n    return valid_substring_count"}
