{"task_id": "Mbpp/84", "solution": "_memo = {1: 1, 2: 1}\n\ndef sequence(n: int) -> int:\n    \"\"\"\n    Calculates the nth number of the Newman-Conway sequence using memoization.\n    P(1) = 1, P(2) = 1, P(n) = P(P(n-1)) + P(n-P(n-1)) for n > 2.\n    \"\"\"\n    if n in _memo:\n        return _memo[n]\n\n    p_n_minus_1 = sequence(n - 1)\n    result = sequence(p_n_minus_1) + sequence(n - p_n_minus_1)\n    _memo[n] = result\n    return result"}
